// among_us — Imposter melee Kill on isolated Crew. AbilityId 1
// (alphabetical: Kill < Task < Vote among the 3 Among Us abilities).
//
// `damage 100` lowers via the standard "damage" arm; the dispatcher
// writes EffectDamageApplied (kind=26) per cast. The .sim's
// ApplyDamageFromChronicle re-emits as `Damaged` so the witness
// chronicle consumer can read the (killer, victim) pair and the
// reaper can flip alive=0. Damage is one-shot lethal (Crew start
// hp=100; 100 dmg + reaper transition fires alive=0 in one tick).

ability Kill {
    target: enemy
    range: 1.5
    cooldown: 8
    hint: damage

    damage 100.0 [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
